---- MODULE space_unassigned__operator_primed_arguments__action_constraint ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == x = 0
Next == x' = x /\ y' = y /\ Same(x', y')
Con == x' = x
====

